Package: gremlin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libsecret-tools
Description: GREMLIN AI MCP orchestrator for Linux
 Licensed local GREMLIN MCP runtime, native Linux Control Center and XDG-aware
 installation/diagnostics tooling. The Control Center discovers and connects
 supported Linux AI clients including Codex, OpenCode, Claude Code, Gemini CLI,
 Cursor, Visual Studio Code/Copilot and Windsurf while preserving client configs
 through native CLI registration or backed-up atomic configuration merges.
